      "source": "Using Spring HATEOAS’s <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/reference/html/#fundamentals.obtaining-links.builder\"><code>LinkBuilder</code></a> with <code>linkTo()</code>, <code>slash()</code>, and so on.",
      "translation": "使用 Spring HATEOAS 的<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/reference/html/#fundamentals.obtaining-links.builder\"><code>LinkBuilder</code></a>，配合<code>linkTo()</code>、<code>slash()</code>等方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Using Spring Data REST’s implementation of <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"api/java/org/springframework/data/rest/webmvc/support/RepositoryEntityLinks.html\">RepositoryEntityLinks</a></code>.",
      "translation": "使用 Spring Data REST 对<code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"api/java/org/springframework/data/rest/webmvc/support/RepositoryEntityLinks.html\">RepositoryEntityLinks</a></code>的实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provide a link to the collection resource of the specified type (<code>Person</code>, in this case).",
      "translation": "请提供指定类型（此处为 <code>Person</code>）的集合资源链接。",
      "count": 1
