    {
      "source": "This section details various ways to integrate with Spring Data REST components, whether from a Spring application that is using Spring Data REST or from other means.",
      "translation": "本节详细介绍了与 Spring Data REST 组件集成的各种方式，无论是来自使用 Spring Data REST 的 Spring 应用程序，还是来自其他途径。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Sometimes you need to add links to exported resources in your own custom-built Spring MVC controllers. There are three basic levels of linking available:",
      "translation": "有时，您需要将链接添加到自行构建的 Spring MVC 控制器中导出的资源。可用的链接级别共有三种基本类型：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Manually assembling links.",
      "translation": "手动链接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The first suggestion is terrible and should be avoided at all costs. It makes your code brittle and high-risk. The second is handy when creating links to other hand-written Spring MVC controllers. The last one, which we explore in the rest of this section, is good for looking up resource links that are exported by Spring Data REST.",
      "translation": "第一个建议非常糟糕，应不惜一切代价避免使用。它会使代码变得脆弱且风险极高。第二个建议在创建指向其他手写 Spring MVC 控制器的链接时非常实用。最后一个建议将在本节其余部分进行探讨，它适用于查找由 Spring Data REST 导出的资源链接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Consider the following class ,which uses Spring’s autowiring:",
      "translation": "考虑以下使用 Spring 自动注入功能的类：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "With the class in the preceding example, you can use the following operations:",
      "translation": "在上一示例中的类中，您可以使用以下操作：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provide a link to a single resource.",
      "translation": "请提供一个单一资源的链接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provide a link to a paged resource.",
      "translation": "请提供一个分页资源的链接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
