      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nAll of the search-based links support extra parameters for paging and sorting. See <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"api/java/org/springframework/data/rest/webmvc/support/RepositoryEntityLinks.html\">RepositoryEntityLinks</a></code> for the details. There is also <code>linkFor(Class&lt;?&gt; type)</code>, but that returns a Spring HATEOAS <code>LinkBuilder</code>, which returns you to the lower level API. Try to use the other ones first.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n所有基于搜索的链接都支持分页和排序的额外参数。有关详细信息，请参阅 <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"api/java/org/springframework/data/rest/webmvc/support/RepositoryEntityLinks.html\">RepositoryEntityLinks</a></code>。此外还有 <code>linkFor(Class&lt;?&gt; type)</code> 方法，但它返回的是 Spring HATEOAS 的 <code>LinkBuilder</code>，这会让您回到更底层的 API。请优先尝试使用其他方法。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
